es":[{"name":"Theme Orange"}],"symbolKind":"property"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemeiconcomponenttokensprovider\/colorcontentstatuswarninginverseinternalshape"]}],"references":{"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeIconComponentTokensProvider/colorContentStatusWarningInverseInternalShape":{"title":"colorContentStatusWarningInverseInternalShape","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemeiconcomponenttokensprovider\/colorcontentstatuswarninginverseinternalshape","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeIconComponentTokensProvider\/colorContentStatusWarningInverseInternalShape","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"colorContentStatusWarningInverseInternalShape","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:@M@OUDSTokensSemantic@objc(cs)MultipleColorSemanticToken","text":"MultipleColorSemanticToken","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Has for value token MultipleColorSemanticToken(light: colors.opacityTransparentDark, dark: colors.repositoryWarningHigh) (= light: “#FFFFFF00” \/ dark: “#856A00FF”)"}],"kind":"symbol"},"ic_theme_orange.png":{"identifier":"ic_theme_orange.png","alt":null,"variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSThemesOrange\/ic_theme_orange.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"type":"image"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange","title":"Theme Orange","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The Orange theme overrides some tokens from the basic "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" and should be seen as the default theme for the OUDS library with the Orange brand colors for example."}],"images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_theme_orange.png"}],"role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange","type":"topic"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeIconComponentTokensProvider":{"title":"OrangeThemeIconComponentTokensProvider","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemeiconcomponenttokensprovider","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeIconComponentTokensProvider","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OrangeThemeIconComponentTokensProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OrangeThemeIconComponentTokensProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A class which wraps all "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"component  tokens of icons"}]},{"type":"text","text":" for "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"icons"}]},{"type":"text","text":" used in some components like "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTag"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Contains also references to semantic tokens providers so as to be able to use them to define the component tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This provider should be integrated as a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllIconComponentTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation inside "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to provide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"all tokens to the users. It helps users to override some of the tokens and assign them to an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation to use."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Custom themes can use subclass of "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeIconComponentTokensProvider","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and apply the provider they need."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It implements also the protocol "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"IconomponentTokens"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to expose the component tokens for "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"icons"}]},{"type":"text","text":" through any "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Icons"}]},{"type":"text","text":" components tokens are defined with raw and semantic tokens of colors (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllColorSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://OUDSTokensSemantic/documentation/OUDSTokensSemantic/MultipleColorSemanticToken":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/MultipleColorSemanticToken","title":"MultipleColorSemanticToken","abstract":[{"text":"Kind of semantic tokens which will wrap a combination of ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/ColorSemanticToken","type":"reference"},{"text":" depending to ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"color scheme"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" (i.e. ligh mode or dark mode).","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Kind of composite token with multiple values, but not named “composite” because this word is already used in the design system.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Allows to gather the multiple-value tokens from ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Figma"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" inside one object.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"If a color token exists with its value depending to the color scheme, it must be packed in such ``MultipleColorSemanticToken`","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MultipleColorSemanticToken","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudstokenssemantic\/multiplecolorsemantictoken","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MultipleColorSemanticToken","kind":"identifier"}]}}}